      "writtenOn": "2022-07-11T19:35:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note, that this function isn\u0027t technically correct in all cases. All interfaces that have configured NetworkCapabilities cannot be used for tethering anymore; these interfaces don\u0027t have to be restricted (although it might be a reasonable assumption that they are). In any case, I think a better (implementation-agnostic) approach would be to request the tethered interface and see if anything is returned within X seconds. See https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/cts/net/src/android/net/cts/EthernetManagerTest.kt;l\u003d456?q\u003dassumeNoInterfaceForTetheringAvailable",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 247,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 254,
        "endChar": 89
      },
      "revId": "c183516d351f42407590b22b55d967b92259232e",
